$E$ and $F$ are joined by chord $EF$, $O$ is the centre, and $G$ is a point on the circumference. Which angle is the angle at the circumference subtended by $EF$?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\draw (O) circle (2);
\fill (O) circle (1.5pt) node[below left] {$O$};
\coordinate (E) at (-1.97,0.347);
\coordinate (F) at (1.286,1.532);
\coordinate (G) at (0.347,-1.97);
\node[above left] at (E) {$E$};
\node[above right] at (F) {$F$};
\node[below] at (G) {$G$};
\draw (E) -- (F);
\draw (O) -- (E);
\draw (O) -- (F);
\draw (G) -- (E);
\draw (G) -- (F);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

